# Phase-1/2 handoff. Lives at the REPO ROOT, not under docs/ — the pattern
# has no leading slash so it matches at any depth if it is ever moved.
AGENT_HANDOFF.md

# Stray dumps from malformed shell redirects (e.g. `cmd >--000.ppm`)
--*.ppm

# Browser-automation tool artifacts
.playwright-mcp/

# Face-recognition ONNX weights (250MB+, exceed GitHub's 100MB limit).
# Fetched during setup — see docs/LAUNCH_GUIDE_LINUX.md §Face models.
backend/InternSystem.API/Models/AI/*.onnx
docs/PHASE_2D_PLAN.md
